# Contributing

This repository only hosts the official MyHRT APK downloads. It contains no source code, so pull requests are not accepted.

Ways to help:

- **Report a bug or suggest a feature:** use the [contact form](https://myhrt.health/contact/) (no email needed) or email hello@myhrt.health.
- **Report a security or privacy issue:** please do this privately, as described in the [security policy](https://github.com/stugalabs/myhrt-security/blob/main/SECURITY.md). Never in a public issue.
- **Verify the app's security claims:** see [myhrt-security](https://github.com/stugalabs/myhrt-security).
- **Support the project:** [myhrt.health/support](https://myhrt.health/support/)
